    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d239">

                <pb facs="0309" n="233" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg233"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 839.001H39</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to Minister Russell </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-08-02T18:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 2, 1916, 6 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>In its consideration of the advisability of recognizing Provisional President or
                    of withholding such recognition until assurances of reforms are obtained, the
                    Department would welcome an expression of your opinion.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
